This package is an adopter of the AlgoVoi substrate. It recomputes the AlgoVoi
action_ref (RFC 8785 JCS over {agent_id, action_type, scope, timestamp_ms}, with an
integer-millisecond timestamp_ms) and exposes a drift predicate over it. The
canonicalisation base and the action_ref derivation are imported from the substrate
and are not modified.

Canonical conformance vectors: conformance/recompute_drift_v1/vectors.json, whose
action_ref values are produced by the algovoi-substrate package.

If you build on this package, preserve this NOTICE file in your distribution and pin
